<p>On further thought&#8230; it occurs to me that it could be kind neat to incorporate the real-live man-eating tree myths into this article. Maybe even specify that a disinformation campaign was put into practice once this tree's anomalous properties were realized (maybe the Foundation even once thought it was just something natural).</p>
<p>It also occurs to me that you could add a mimic element; perhaps the picture looks like a <em>Welwitschia</em> because it's <em>supposed</em> to look like a <em>Welwitschia</em>. Full blown at-will shapeshifting might be a bit much, but maybe new instances/'buds'/whatever of this tree have one specific template plant of a certain size that they can mimic? The better for luring in prey animals.</p>

